+
+  /* CPSR (flags, basically): 32 bits:
+        bit 31 - N (negative)
+        bit 30 - Z (zero)
+        bit 29 - C (carry)
+        bit 28 - V (overflow)
+        bit 27 - Q (saturation flag, sticky)
